OL,3,GNEWSATown heals after asylum hotel
OL,4,Aprotests but scars run deep
OL,5,
OL,6,FNearly 18 months since violence came to
OL,7,Fthe quiet and well-to-do High Street of
OL,8,FEpping, the wounds are still there.
OL,10,F"You can feel the scars," says Anita, a
OL,11,F51-year-old primary school teacher.
OL,13,F"If you walk through now, it's not
OL,14,Fquite the same, it's not quite as
OL,15,Frelaxed, we will need a bit of time to
OL,16,Frecover from it, for businesses to
OL,17,Frecover from it as well."
