OL,3,GNEWSATown heals after asylum hotel
OL,4,Aprotests but scars run deep
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe town became the national stage for
OL,7,Fanti-asylum seeker protests in July
OL,8,F2025, and during some of that violence,
OL,9,Fpolice officers were injured, bottles
OL,10,Fwere thrown and police vehicles
OL,11,Fdamaged.
